## Calculated Metrics Reference

These are derived metrics that should be consistent across documents:

- **Revenue per Employee (FY 2024):** AED 485,100,000 / 1,200 = AED 404,250
- **Average Deal Size (FY 2024):** AED 485,100,000 / 890 new customers = AED 545,056
- **Customer Acquisition Cost (CAC):** AED 136,143,000 / 890 = AED 152,970
- **LTV:CAC Ratio:** (AED 545,056 × 3 years) / AED 152,970 = 10.7
- **Burn Rate (FY 2024):** AED 22,491,000 / 12 = AED 1,874,250 per month
- **Cash on Hand (Post Series D):** AED 441,000,000
- **Runway:** 441,000,000 / 1,874,250 = 23.5 months

